9. Design Deliverables

At the end of the Project Design Phase, you can prepare:

Simple system design

Main screen designs

Comic editor layout

Basic database design

User flow diagram

Simple prototype/wireframe


Final Outcome

The Comic Craft Project Design Phase creates a simple blueprint for the application. It defines how the screens will look, how users will move through the system, and how the comic creation process will work before actual development begins.Comic Craft – Project Design Phase

